== Description ==
Increases evocation efficiency, based on pet time. Increases incantation spells efficiency. Autocasts {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Kelphior's Black Beam}} on its own even if it's not selected on the spell panel.

Experience gained per second depends on number of upgrades bought and time the pet is active.

== Pet Ability ==

Multiplies Evocation efficiency by:
<br><math>P \times L^{1.25} \times (T + 1)^4 \times 0.05 + 1</math>
<br>After 3 days:
<br><math>P \times L^{1.25} \times \left( (T - 2)^{5.25} + 256 \right) \times 0.05 + 1</math>


Multiplies Incantation efficiency by:
<br><math>L \times 0.25 + 1</math>


Casts {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Kelphior's Black Beam}} (if available) on ability activation, every:
<br><math>\operatorname{floor}\left((1 - T)^3 \times 64\right) + 1</math>
<br>seconds (minimum 1).
* Activation speed is '''not''' affected by Time Distortion (see {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Temporal Distortion}}).
* Activation speed '''is''' affected by Pet Abilty Charging Speed (see {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Collar Of Obedience}}, {{ItemTooltip|item_name=Whiplash}}).
* Timeskips (see {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Refined Wormhole}}) will simulate casts with base activation speed (i.e. no collar/whip/TD).


where:
* <math>T = \frac{\text{Real Pet Time, in Seconds}}{86400} = \text{Real Pet Time, in Days (Unrounded)}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left(U^T + F \right) \times M</math>

where:
* <math>U = \text{Bought Upgrades}</math>
* <math>T = 0.04 \leq \text{Real Pet Time, in Days} \leq 1</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

